<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="t00837">
	<title>Replacing the air cleaner filter</title>
	<shortdesc>Replace the air cleaner filter when necessary, and do not wash it.</shortdesc>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>air cleaner
					<indexterm>replacing the air cleaner filter</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<taskbody>
		<context id="e04917">
			<p>You can clean the filter when inspecting the air cleaner compartment. Use compressed air to clean the filter.</p>
		</context>
		<steps id="e04918">
			<step>
				<cmd>Loosen the air cleaner cover attaching clips (1) and open the cover.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04919">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04920">
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP327_D12_061_1.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<fig id="e04921">
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP327_D12_016_1.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Pull up the air cleaner cover (2) and open it.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04922">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04923">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_D12_015_2.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<fig id="e04924">
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP327_D12_018_1.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Wipe the inside of the air cleaner filter cover.</cmd>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Replace the air cleaner filter.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04925">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04926">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_D12_059_1.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<fig id="e04927">
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP327_D12_060_1.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Reassemble the air cleaner filter parts and cover in the reverse order of disassembly.</cmd>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Install the air cleaner cover by first inserting the hinge part (3) correctly, and then attaching the clips.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04928">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04929">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_D12_057_1.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<fig id="e04930">
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP327_D12_058_1.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
		</steps>
		<postreq id="e04931">
			<p>Replace the filter according to the Maintenance Schedule.</p>
			<p>If you drive your vehicle in extremely dusty or sandy areas, replace the filter more often than the usual recommended intervals. (Refer to <xref href="t00793.dita#t00793"/>.)</p>
			<note type="note" id="e04932">
				<ul id="e04933">
					<li>
						<p>Do not drive with the air cleaner filter removed. This results in excessive engine wear.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>When removing the air cleaner filter, make sure that dust or dirt does not enter the air intake, as this can cause damage.</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>Use genuine replacement parts from a professional workshop. Kia recommends visiting an authorized Kia dealer or service partner.</p>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</note>
		</postreq>
	</taskbody>
